    Examples
    --------
    >>> import lucid
    >>> a = lucid.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])
    >>> b = lucid.tensor([4.0, 5.0, 6.0])
    >>> lucid.div(a, b)
    Tensor([...])
    >>> lucid.div(lucid.tensor([7, -7]), 2, rounding_mode="trunc")
    Tensor([...])
    >>> lucid.div(lucid.tensor([7, -7]), 2, rounding_mode="floor")
    Tensor([...])
    """
    ...
